{"blocks":[{"paragraph":{"format":{"heading":1,"spaceAfterPt":6},"id":"5f887df3-c267-444c-b0a6-61ee33bef31b","mark":0,"spans":[[40,0]],"text":"Field report: mixed scripts across pages"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"fde646d7-b7a8-42a4-84cd-c5a0a12c33eb","mark":0,"spans":[[9,1],[37,0],[14,2],[177,0],[13,3],[13,0]],"text":"This page mixes scripts in one flow: English, עברית (Hebrew), العربية (Arabic), हिन्दी (Devanagari), 中文排版 and 日本語, emoji 👩‍👩‍👧 🇺🇸 and combining marks (é). Selection, caret movement and search keep grapheme clusters whole. Read the specification for details."}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"673ee7d6-4cc9-4e40-a077-1ee63ee8229c","mark":0,"spans":[[39,0],[1,4],[48,0]],"text":"An inline object sits on the baseline: ￼ and text continues after it, wrapping as usual."}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"46c1fd21-bcf5-4145-aed2-28d11273a008","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"7b8c6562-425b-491d-88bd-c684a43e35d0","mark":0,"spans":[[30,0]],"text":"Bulleted item with שלום inside"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"46c1fd21-bcf5-4145-aed2-28d11273a008","listLevel":1,"spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"36101f51-7af2-458d-a483-70ace2544702","mark":0,"spans":[[14,0]],"text":"A nested point"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"46c1fd21-bcf5-4145-aed2-28d11273a008","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"c0be6fe6-b718-4bd4-880c-545cb3c08f11","mark":0,"spans":[[23,0]],"text":"Back at the first level"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"5bb88a04-26e1-4fd3-9a68-af99b2de0a8d","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"90287167-4e7b-482d-94ce-e4dde7c58937","mark":0,"spans":[[17,0]],"text":"Numbered step one"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"5bb88a04-26e1-4fd3-9a68-af99b2de0a8d","spaceAfterPt":8},"id":"7fb21b54-ee1b-4a9d-afb9-a1f4725b9850","mark":0,"spans":[[17,0]],"text":"Numbered step two"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"lineHeight":1.2,"list":"5bb88a04-26e1-4fd3-9a68-af99b2de0a8d",