},{"paragraph":{"id":"f5a5c85f-c38d-4db9-82ff-1f9f51d9e350","mark":0,"spans":[[162,0]],"text":"Follow-up paragraph 1: observations continue with ordinary prose that wraps to the column width and fills the page, so the next objects land near a page boundary."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"9f309631-caa1-4013-b9f0-e54cfa730590","mark":0,"spans":[[162,0]],"text":"Follow-up paragraph 2: observations continue with ordinary prose that wraps to the column width and fills the page, so the next objects land near a page boundary."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"f7e15571-4d4e-4366-a097-7fc6a2c44765","mark":0,"spans":[[162,0]],"text":"Follow-up paragraph 3: observations continue with ordinary prose that wraps to the column width and fills the page, so the next objects land near a page boundary."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"e8121b70-929e-4e05-bd2a-f2aceeb88036","mark":0,"spans":[[162,0]],"text":"Follow-up paragraph 4: observations continue with ordinary prose that wraps to the column width and fills the page, so the next objects land near a page boundary."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"13b2e4f9-33d5-4915-a327-337fa9f71023","mark":0,"spans":[[162,0]],"text":"Follow-up paragraph 5: observations continue with ordinary prose that wraps to the column width and fills the page, so the next objects land near a page boundary."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"cbeeab9f-65bd-4a49-8907-bdbfaa0445b8","mark":0,"spans":[[162,0]],"text":"Follow-up paragraph 6: observations continue with ordinary prose that wraps to the column width and fills the page, so the next objects land near a page boundary."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"6b6eb68b-4449-4d30-b806-4c96e7935f7c","mark":0,"spans":[[1,5],[292,0]],"text":"￼This paragraph anchors a floating figure at the end edge. When the figure would cross the bottom of the page, the paragraph moves to the next page together with it, and the text wraps beside it. The figure keeps its logical anchor, so undo, copy and reflow move it with the text that owns it."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"9be0560f-b17f-45d2-8ab4-1adaa353a4b8","mark":0,"spans":[[1,6],[70,0]],"text":"￼A page-anchored stamp belongs to the page where this paragraph starts."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"e23a045b-eea8-454c-8463-ca142e6a7934","mark":0,"spans":[[71,0]],"text":"Closing paragraph 1 keeps the flow going with more text for pagination."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"bba166d1-3d19-46f1-985c-25915ef34bd6","mark":0,"spans":[[71,0]],"text":"Closing paragraph 2 keeps the flow going with more text for pagination."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"8aea713a-728c-45d0-809d-3919daa4964d","mark":0,"spans":[[71,0]],"text":"Closing paragraph 3 keeps the flow going with more text for pagination."}},{"paragraph":{"id":"19006d53-04b9-4e91-b079-5b6acc2385b2","mark":0,"spans":[[71,0]],"text":"Closing paragraph 4 keeps the flow going with more text for pagination."}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"heading":1,"pageBreakBefore":true,"spaceAfterPt":6},"id":"0d99140f-5114-4007-8b3b-bfbad655d42e","mark":0,"spans":[[8,0]],"text":"Appendix"}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"spaceAfterPt":6},"id":"5a262a84-dfeb-4cae-a4ec-660e86269afb","mark":0,"spans":[[71,0]],"text":"זוהי פסקה בעברית שמתחילה מימין לשמאל וכוללת English words ומספרים 2026."}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"spaceAfterPt":6},"id":"3fcdcff9-ad4c-45fe-88e8-aabf0d295ba5","mark":0,"spans":[[51,0]],"text":"هذه فقرة عربية مع كلمات متصلة وأرقام 123 ونص مختلط."}},{"paragraph":{"format":{"align":"justify","spaceAfterPt":6},"id":"b97e4caf-b3c0-4498-a48a-95360cd10ab6","mark":0,"spans":[[185,0]],"text":"A justified paragraph spreads its words to both edges of the column except on its final line. Justification, alignment and direction are paragraph attributes; runs keep their own fonts."}}],"defaults":{"family":"sans-serif","sizePt":11},"documentId":"5dacdfc9-a5da-494a-9dbc-ea2677f0a492","formats":[{},{"weight":700},{"color":"#3f9fd8","italic":true},{"href":"https://example.org/specification"},{"object":"082bb5e4-b51f-455f-a4cd-d2a8f0c58a84"},{"object":"57230d57-8f24-4c13-ab27-52a2b906e0b2"},{"object":"89accb63-a127-4a79-ae3f-